    {
      "block_id": "p-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay is currently at **Level 1 (Partially Controlled)** for most core components. While it has a deterministic serialization foundation (`dump_canonical_json`), it suffers from \"Ambient Environment Dependency\" (global home paths, unsorted filesystem traversal, random IDs).",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-5",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Findings Matrix",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-6",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "ID",
        "Area",
        "Level",
        "Priority",
        "Owner",
        "Files",
        "Risk"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "**DET-001**",
          "Evidence root resolution",
          "1",
          "P0",
          "config",
          "`_vibe_home.py`",
          "Global home defaults mix প্রকল্পের state."
        ],
        [
          "**DET-002**",
          "Session/run identity",
          "1",
          "P2",
          "identity",
          "`agent_loop.py`",
          "Random UUIDs make sessions non-reproducible."
        ],
        [
          "**DET-003**",
