      "content": "DET-001: Global Home Bias",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Location: `vibe/core/paths/_vibe_home.py` Risk: All evidence from all projects ends up in one folder, making per-run validation and cleanup difficult. Recommendation: Implement local-first resolution (Git root discovery).",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-10",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Recommended Backlog",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "1.  **Mission: Monotonic Sequence Enforcer**: Add sequence numbers to all JSONL events. 2.  **Mission: Content-Addressed Evidence**: Use hashes for session and artifact IDs. 3.  **Mission: Canonical Traversal**: Enforce `sorted()` on all directory walks/glob results.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    }
